" end="02:51.593" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ke</span><span begin="02:51.593" end="02:52.397" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ru</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="02:52.886" end="02:53.109" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">re</span><span begin="02:53.109" end="02:53.717" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">dii</span><span begin="02:53.880" end="02:54.129" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">wara</span><span begin="02:54.129" end="02:54.636" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">wanai</span><span begin="02:54.636" end="02:54.921" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">de</span><span begin="02:54.921" end="02:55.256" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kii</span><span begin="02:55.256" end="02:55.518" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="02:55.518" end="02:55.777" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ha</span><span begin="02:55.777" end="02:56.244" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">nii</span><span begin="02:56.529" end="02:56.964" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mitsume</span><span begin="02:56.964" end="02:57.253" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">at</span><span begin="02:57.253" end="02:57.485" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te</span><span begin="02:57.485" end="02:57.879" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">itaku</span><span begin="02:57.879" end="02:58.177" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="02:58.177" end="02:58.916" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kimi</span><span begin="02:59.119" end="02:59.385" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">to</span><span begin="02:59.385" end="03:00.198" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">futari</span><span begin="03:00.417" end="03:01.051" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">itta</span><span begin="03:01.051" end="03:01.375" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ri</span><span begin="03:01.375" end="03:01.678" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kita</span><span begin="03:01.678" end="03:02.036" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ri</span><span begin="03:02.036" end="03:02.452" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">shitai</span><span begin="03:02.452" end="03:02.636" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">da</span><span begin="03:02.636" end="03:03.124" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ke</span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="03:03.507" end="03:03.759" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">bei</span><span begin="03:03.759" end="03:04.360" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">bii</span><span begin="03:04.493" end="03:04.826" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kodomo</span><span begin="03:04.826" end="03:06.109" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">mitai ni</span><span begin="03:06.109" end="03:06.775" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">koi</span><span begin="03:06.775" end="03:07.020" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ga</span><span begin="03:07.020" end="03:07.359" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">shita</span><span begin="03:07.359" end="03:08.013" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">i</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="03:08.396" end="03:08.785" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">kaki</span><span begin="03:08.785" end="03:09.500" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">chirashi</span><span begin="03:09.500" end="03:10.084" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">te i</span><span begin="03:10.084" end="03:10.637" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ku</span><span begin="03:11.356" end="03:12.014" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">boku</span><span begin="03:12.014" end="03:12.628" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">ra no</span><span begin="03:12.628" end="03:13.427" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">sutou</span><span begin="03:13.427" end="03:13.772" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">rii</span><span begin="03:13.772" end="03:14.668" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml">rain</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">如果我们两个人 能像璀璨电影那样</text><text for="L2">若能重新相遇 你想怎么做</text><text for="L3">也没什么玄机 今天不过是昨天的延续</text><text for="L4">日子只是继续 徒留一片茫然</text><text for="L5">细微的脚步声 床单摆放的位置</text><text for="L6">光凭这些 就全都懂了</text><text for="L7">看穿的谎言 藏起的真心</text><text for="L8">那一切都曾让我深深疼惜</text><text for="L9">亲爱的 先别笑听我说</text><text for="L10">甜心 我只想和你静静对望</text><text for="L11">只想和你两个人 来来又去去</text><text for="L12">宝贝 想谈一场孩子气的恋爱</text><text for="L13">随手写着属于我们的故事线</text><text for="L14">如果我们之中有谁 被残酷不幸击中</text><text for="L15">从此再也不能相见</text><text for="L16">才刚这么想 就快要哭出来</text><text for="L17">日子仍在继续 而且愈发真实</text><text for="L18">你惯常的阴沉脸色 和廉价的无聊话</text><text for="L19">又会当作没看见一样 温柔地对待我吧</text><text for="L20">看穿的谎言 藏起的真心</text><text for="L21">都从你眼中传达给我</text><text for="L22">拉拽啃咬 装作受伤的样子</text><text for="L23">拖到明天早上 又心浮气躁</text><text for="L24">想狠狠受伤 也想永远在你身边</text><text for="L25">现在就让彼此消失得无影无踪</text><text for="L26">亲爱的 什么都别说</text><text for="L27">甜心 请握住我的手</text><text for="L28">除了你之外 我什么都没法想</text><text for="L29">宝贝 想如当初那样去爱</text><text for="L30">不断写下 继续起舞</text><text for="L31">亲爱的 先别笑听我说</text><text for="L32">甜心 我只想和你静静对望</text><text for="L33">只想和你两个人 来来又去去</text><text for="L34">宝贝 想谈一场孩子气的恋爱</text><text for="L35">随手写着属于我们的故事线</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:14.668"><div begin="00:11.309" end="00:50.481" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="00:11.309" end="00:16.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:11.309" end="00:11.717">例</span><span begin="00:11.717" end="00:12.069">えば</span><span begin="00:12.069" end="00:12.432">僕</span><span begin="00:12.432" end="00:12.775">ら</span><span begin="00:12.775" end="00:13.750">二人 </span><span begin="00:14.035" end="00:14.416">煌</span><span begin="00:14.416" end="00:14.734">めく</span><span begin="00:14.734" end="00:15.318">映画</span><span begin="00:15.318" end="00:15.667">の</span><span begin="00:15.667" end="00:15.918">よう</span><span begin="00:15.918" end="00:16.526">に</span></p><p begin="00:16.635" end="00:20.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:16.635" end="00:17.220">出会い</span><span begin="00:17.220" end="00:17.473">な</span><span begin="00:17.473" end="00:18.666">おせたら</span><span begin="00:18.666" end="00:19.374">どう</span><span begin="00:19.533" end="00:19.834">した</span><span begin="00:19.834" end="00:20.301">い</span></p><p begin="00:21.924" end="00:27.054" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:21.924" end="00:22.329">何</span><span begin="00:22.329" end="00:22.564">も</span><span begin="00:22.564" end="00:22.932">謎</span><span begin="00:22.932" end="00:23.313">めい</span><span begin="00:23.313" end="00:23.631">て</span><span begin="00:23.631" end="00:24.281">ない </span><span begin="00:24.615" end="00:24.948">今日</span><span begin="00:24.948" end="00:25.148">は</span><span begin="00:25.148" end="00:25.564">昨日</span><span begin="00:25.564" end="00:25.897">の</span><span begin="00:25.897" end="00:26.380">続</span><span begin="00:26.380" end="00:27.054">き</span></p><p begin="00:27.163" end="00:30.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:27.163" end="00:27.711">日々は</span><span begin="00:27.711" end="00:28.193">続</span><span begin="00:28.193" end="00:28.527">く</span><span begin="00:28.527" end="00:29.212">ただ</span><span begin="00:29.212" end="00:29.777">ぼん</span><span begin="00:30.161" end="00:30.415">や</span><span begin="00:30.415" end="00:30.832">り</span></p><p begin="00:31.788" end="00:36.992" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:31.788" end="00:32.191">微</span><span begin="00:32.489" end="00:32.996">かな</span><span begin="00:33.156" end="00:33.615">足</span><span begin="00:33.873" end="00:34.231">音 </span><span begin="00:34.449" end="00:34.915">シー</span><span begin="00:35.156" end="00:35.617">ツの</span><span begin="00:35.841" end="00:36.309">置く</span><span begin="00:36.441" end="00:36.992">場所</span></p><p begin="00:37.057" end="00:41.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:37.057" end="00:37.317">そ</span><span begin="00:37.317" end="00:37.774">れ</span><span begin="00:37.774" end="00:37.979">だ</span><span begin="00:37.979" end="00:38.476">け</span><span begin="00:38.476" end="00:38.